                        <h2 class="title">让文学点燃青春梦想！叶圣陶杯全国中学生新作文大赛总决赛在绍兴一中成功举办</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2024年05月31日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=19928"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:19928},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=19928";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
